[node name="TrackMask" type="Node" parent="." unique_id=967854499]
script = ExtResource("2_trackmask")

; How much snow has settled on everything facing the sky. One scalar for the
; whole world -- roofs, branches, crossarms, the truck's bonnet, and the road
; filling in under it. It reads the weather off Snowfall and the day off the
; clock's events, and it INTEGRATES rather than being told a depth, which is
; what makes 切记突变 a property of the design rather than of the tuning.
;
; A plain Node with no transform: it is a fact about the world, not a place in
; it. Placed here beside the other two rasters and above everything that reads
; it, though nothing depends on the order -- TerrainRenderer finds it through
; the ServiceRegistry and it settles itself on the first frame precisely so that
; scene order cannot matter.
[node name="SnowAccumulation" type="Node" parent="." unique_id=967854500]
script = ExtResource("29_accumulation")

